==English==

===Etymology===
Proprietary name, from {{etyl|fr|en}} {{term|oui||yes|lang=fr}} + {{etyl|de|en}} {{term|ja||yes|lang=de}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈwiːdʒə/|/ˈwiːdʒi/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}
